 "_comment": [
  "CITATIONS THAT WERE ALREADY ON THE REGISTER WHEN check_citations LANDED, 15 September 2026.",
  "",
  "THE GATE IS NOT RETROSPECTIVE AND THIS FILE IS WHY. Every URL below is cited by a row or a",
  "technology and appears in no cache index and in no hand-retrieval manifest. They are not",
  "wrong: most are pages somebody read before this register kept a fetch index at all, and the",
  "hydrogen and batteries passes predate the caches that would have recorded them. What they",
  "are is UNPROVEN -- nothing in the repository shows that anybody opened them.",
  "",
  "THE LIST CAN ONLY SHRINK. check_citations fails on any cited URL that is neither fetched,",
  "nor hand-read, nor on this list, so a new composed URL cannot enter -- which is the defect",
  "the gate was written for. And it fails if this file names a URL nothing cites any more, so",
  "the debt cannot be padded or left to rot: clearing a citation means deleting its line.",
  "",
  "HOW A LINE LEAVES: fetch the page through the sector's declared reader, or read it in a",
  "browser and file it under sources/manual/ with a MANIFEST entry. Either way the URL then",
  "appears in an index and its line here must go.",
  "",
  "COUNT WHEN THIS FILE WAS WRITTEN: 234."
 ],
